('logarithmic energy derivative of local density of states at Fermi energy','approximately proportional to','mesoscopic Seebeck coefficient','The mesoscopic Seebeck coefficient is approximately proportional to the logarithmic energy derivative of local density of states at the Fermi energy.','association'),
